{"source":{"data":"@shop\nFeature: Shopping cart\n  As a shopper I want a cart so I can buy things.\n\n  Background:\n    Given an empty cart\n\n  @smoke @fast\n  Scenario: Add a single item\n    When I add 2 \"apple\" items\n    Then the cart has 2 items\n    And I take a screenshot\n\n  @regression\n  Scenario: Wrong total is reported\n    When I add 3 \"pear\" items\n    Then the cart has 4 items\n\n  Scenario: Checkout is pending\n    When I add 1 \"plum\" items\n    Then I can check out\n\n  Scenario: Gift wrap is undefined\n    When I ask for gift wrapping\n\n  @outline\n  Scenario Outline: Add several kinds\n    When I add <count> \"<fruit>\" items\n    Then the cart has <count> items\n\n    Examples:\n      | fruit  | count |\n      | kiwi   | 1     |\n      | mango  | 5     |\n","uri":"features/cart.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
